# Rust / ICP canister build output. Regenerated by `dfx build`; never committed —
# 183MB of it was tracked and broke the Amplify build-output cap (2026-08-02).
target/

# dfx's build/deploy cache — the sibling of `target/` above, missed in the
# 2026-08-02 cleanup and still carrying 1.6MB of compiled .wasm plus generated
# Candid bindings (service.did.js, index.js). Regenerated by `dfx build`.
# Nothing in this repo reads from it: the canonical IDL that IS source lives in
# services/ops/idl/. Untracked 2026-08-15.
.dfx/

# Hardhat compilation output — ABIs, bytecode and build-info compiler dumps,
# regenerated by `npx hardhat compile` (hardhat.config.js). 2.4MB tracked, of
# which one build-info dump alone was 1.7MB. Contract SOURCES stay tracked;
# their compiled artifacts do not. Untracked 2026-08-15.
artifacts/
cache/

# Design reference images — 2021 KNYTDesignQube screenshots. Removed 2026-08-02.
# The DesignQube *guidance* (tokens/constraints/components JSON) stays tracked;
# the raster references belong in Supabase Storage. See CLAUDE.md > Dense Materials.
apps/metame/*DesignQube/**/*.png
apps/metame/*DesignQube/**/*.PNG
apps/metame/*DesignQube/**/*.jpeg
apps/metame/*DesignQube/**/*.jpg

